WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.455
You sketch your idea in R, or in Python.

2
00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:06.780
It is too slow.

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.620
So you rewrite it in C.

4
00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.411
Julia ends that.

5
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:22.390
Write it like R. Run it like C.

6
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.180
One language, from sketch to speed.

7
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.810
It began in 2009.

8
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:34.485
Four people wanted C's speed, R's ease and Python's reach, in one language.

9
00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:35.840
In their words:

10
00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.480
Because we are greedy.

11
00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:42.460
The time of Julia is upon us.

12
00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.635
The only question is how to begin.

13
00:00:46.735 --> 00:00:48.015
Julia Time.

14
00:00:48.165 --> 00:00:51.380
This is the case of the missing fleas.

15
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:55.490
Toto's report says the lab's springtails are dying out.

16
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.240
The notebook may say otherwise.

17
00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:03.325
Itchy, Momo, Toto and Eddie need you, and Julia, to find out.

18
00:01:03.525 --> 00:01:07.210
Six steps, each a lesson, then a chapter of the case.

19
00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:11.740
Tables, grouping, joins, then chance and simulation.

20
00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.875
Every idea is explained, shown, then yours to try.

21
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:18.810
Make a mistake, and it tells you what went wrong.

22
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.310
R and Python sit beside the code.

23
00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.940
Then put it to work.

24
00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.535
Hit the targets, and see the speed for yourself.

25
00:01:30.735 --> 00:01:33.025
And at the end, bring your own data.

26
00:01:35.435 --> 00:01:38.140
Are the springtails really dying out?

27
00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.410
Find out.

28
00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:43.065
Free, on your own laptop, and nothing is scored.

29
00:01:43.215 --> 00:01:45.445
The time of Julia is now.

30
00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:47.360
Your time starts here.

